[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0314","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1224","title":"KDE KPF Icon Option 目录遍历漏洞","description":"KDE 个人防火墙（KPF）3.0.1 至 3.0.3a 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 kpf 服务发送带有特制 icon 参数的 URL，即可利用路径遍历绕过访问限制，以 kpf 进程用户权限读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞仅影响文件机密性，不涉及系统完整性或可用性，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1224"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:57Z","remediation":"升级到 KDE 3.1.0 或更高版本（Debian 对应包版本 4:3.1.0-1），该版本已修复 kpf 目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可停止 kpf 服务（kill kpf 进程）或在防火墙层面限制对 kpf 默认端口 8001 的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0164.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/294991","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10347.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20021008-2.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5951","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21934","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1224","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2002/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1224.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1224.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1224.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0313","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1223","title":"GSview DSC 3.0 解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GSview 的 DSC 3.0 解析器中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该解析器被 KDE 1.1 及 KDE 3.0.3a 中的 KGhostView 所使用。远程攻击者可利用特制的 PostScript (.ps) 输入文件触发该溢出，导致目标系统拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证即可远程发起，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1223"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:57Z","remediation":"建议将 KDE 升级至 3.0.4 及以上版本，该版本已修复 KGhostView 中 DSC 3.0 解析器的缓冲区溢出漏洞。无法升级时可从 ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/security_patches/ 下载对应补丁：KDE 3.0.3 应用 post-3.0.3-kdegraphics-kghostview.diff，KDE 2.2.2 应用 post-2.2.2-kdegraphics-kghostview.diff。Red Hat 用户请安装 RHSA-2002:220 更新，Mandrake 用户应用 MDKSA-2002:071，Sun 用户安装 SunSolve 补丁 101426。临时缓解措施为不要用 KGhostView 打开来源不可信的 PostScript (.ps) 或 PDF 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0163.html","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-101426-1","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-155.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11319.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20021008-1.txt","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:071","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1223","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2002/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1223.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/fb9c99184e5f329cbd209ad3b09bfdd07f03b7c6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1223.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1223.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0263","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0836","title":"teTeX tetex dvips 命令执行漏洞","description":"teTeX 软件包中的 dvips PostScript 转换器在处理打印作业时，不安全地调用 system() 函数且未对输入进行充分验证。远程未认证攻击者可通过提交包含恶意字体指令的特制 PostScript 打印作业，触发 dvips 执行任意系统命令，从而在目标系统上获得命令执行权限。该漏洞影响使用 teTeX 软件包的 Linux 发行版（如 Red Hat Linux、Debian、Mandrake、Conectiva 等）中的打印服务组件，攻击向量为网络打印服务（如 LPD、CUPS）接收恶意打印任务，无需用户交互即可远程触发，CVSS 7.5 分（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0836"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:13Z","remediation":"建议升级 teTeX 至 2.0.2 及以上版本（包含 dvips 5.92a 修复版本），或升级至 TeX Live 2003 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，可在打印服务器配置中禁用 dvips 的 -R 选项（禁止外部命令执行），或在打印队列配置中限制仅允许受信任的字体文件，禁止处理未受信的 PostScript 打印作业。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制打印服务端口（如 515/tcp、631/tcp）仅允许受信任 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000537","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103497852330838&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104005975415582&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-207","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10365.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/169841","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-070.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-194.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-195.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/4567","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5978","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0836","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b057d3bcc2a1da38f6284c6c5f111734c51b6e6/2002/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0836.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0836.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0836.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0263.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0055","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1227","title":"Linux-PAM 空密码认证绕过权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux PAM（Pluggable Authentication Modules）0.76 版本存在认证绕过漏洞，该版本将已禁用用户的密码视为空密码（null password）处理，导致本地或远程攻击者可通过空密码认证方式绕过账户禁用限制，以被禁用用户的身份获取系统访问权限。该漏洞影响使用 PAM 0.76 的各类 Linux 发行版，攻击者无需任何特殊权限即可利用，可能导致权限提升或未授权访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1227"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:58Z","remediation":"升级 Linux PAM 库至 0.76-22 或更高版本（Debian 已通过 DSA-177 发布补丁），该版本修复了将禁用用户密码视为空密码的认证逻辑缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/shadow 中将禁用账户的密码字段设为 \"!*\" 而非空值，并确保 pam_unix.so 配置中启用 nullok 选项时仅对明确允许的账户生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-177","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10405.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1227","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1227.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pw86-jwrv-pxmm/GHSA-pw86-jwrv-pxmm.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-177.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1227.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a59bab93-c8ee-4472-a718-dd295321b693.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0054","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1226","title":"Heimdal kadmind 和 kdc 服务器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Heimdal Kerberos 实现 0.5 之前版本中的 kadmind 和 kdc 服务存在未明安全漏洞，远程或本地攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞完全控制目标系统，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Heimdal 0.5 之前的所有版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至 Heimdal 0.5 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1226"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:58Z","remediation":"将 Heimdal 升级至 0.5 或更高版本。Debian 3.0 (woody) 用户升级至 0.4e-7.woody.4，Debian 2.2 (potato) 用户升级至 0.2l-7.4。如无法立即升级，在防火墙层面限制对 kadmind（端口 749）和 kdc（端口 88）服务的访问，仅允许受信管理网段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103341355708817&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103462479621246&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-178","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1226","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1226.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvvj-29m3-wc9p/GHSA-vvvj-29m3-wc9p.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1226","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-178.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5731/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0053","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1225","title":"Heimdal kadmind 和 kdc 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Heimdal 0.5 之前版本的 kadmind 和 kdc 服务中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标服务发送特制的畸形请求触发缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖内存中的关键数据，最终获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响所有运行 Heimdal 0.5 之前版本的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1225"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:57Z","remediation":"立即将 Heimdal 升级至 0.5 或更高版本。SuSE Linux 用户可通过 rpm -Fhv 安装对应发行版更新包（如 SuSE-8.0 的 heimdal-0.4e-191.i386.rpm），安装后执行 /etc/rc.d/kdc restart 重启服务。Gentoo 用户执行 emerge sync && emerge heimdal。Debian 用户参考 DSA-178 安装更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 kadmind（默认端口 464）和 kdc（默认端口 88）的远程访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103341355708817&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103462479621246&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-178","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10116.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1225.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1225","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1225.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1225.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7gh5-g6w7-v7hq/GHSA-7gh5-g6w7-v7hq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-178.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1226.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149400_149500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d06264ac-ddc1-4684-a366-0a494e6ab370.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1226"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0052","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1216","title":"GNU tar 符号链接攻击导致任意文件写入漏洞","description":"GNU tar 1.13.19 至 1.13.24 版本中存在符号链接漏洞，由于安全审查机制被错误禁用，导致在解压特殊构造的 tar 归档文件时，攻击者可以通过嵌入的符号链接将文件写入任意路径。远程攻击者可诱导用户解压恶意 tar 包，实现任意文件覆盖，进而可能导致系统文件被篡改或权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，仅影响数据完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1216"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:56Z","remediation":"升级到 GNU tar 1.13.25 或更高版本，该版本重新启用了符号链接安全检查，可防止 tar 解包时跟随符号链接覆盖任意文件。如无法立即升级，应避免使用受影响版本（1.13.19 至 1.13.24）解压不受信任的 tar 归档，或解压前手动检查归档中是否包含可疑的符号链接条目作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103419290219680&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10224.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2006:219","http://www.openpkg.com/security/advisories/OpenPKG-SA-2006.038.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-096.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2006/CVE-2006-6097.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1216","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2002/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1216.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1216.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/fb9c99184e5f329cbd209ad3b09bfdd07f03b7c6/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1216.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0051","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1215","title":"Linux HA heartbeat 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Heartbeat 0.4.9 及更早版本中存在多处格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 UDP 端口 694 发送特制数据包触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行 Heartbeat 服务的系统，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1215"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:56Z","remediation":"升级 heartbeat 至 0.4.9.0l-7.2 或更高版本（Debian 3.0 woody 对应 DSA-174）。如无法升级，在防火墙或 iptables 层面限制外部对 UDP 694 端口的访问，仅允许受信任源 IP 通信。同时禁用 heartbeat 的格式字符串调试功能（如有），并确保 heartbeat 以最小权限用户运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000540","http://linux-ha.org/security/sec01.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-174","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10357.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_037_heartbeat.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5955","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1215.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1215.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1215","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1215.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1215.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mm3r-mrmx-x8fm/GHSA-mm3r-mrmx-x8fm.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-174.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fe75d298-9773-48c1-9204-2fbd548baecd.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5955/info.html","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/adb0abfbea757d46e846ba7d3640d43b01b979fe/tracker/DSA/DSA-174.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0050","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1200","title":"Balabit Syslog-NG 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Balabit Syslog-NG 1.4.x 1.4.15 之前版本和 1.5.x 1.5.20 之前版本在使用模板文件名或输出时，宏展开过程中遇到常量字符时未正确跟踪缓冲区大小，导致缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的 syslog 消息触发宏展开时的缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务甚至远程代码执行。影响版本包括 Balabit Syslog-NG 1.4.x 1.4.15 之前版本及 1.5.x 1.5.20 之前版本，CVSS 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击向量为网络远程利用，无需认证，攻击复杂度低，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。Balabit 已在 1.4.15 和 1.5.20 版本中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。Debian DSA-175 等发行版也发布了相应安全更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1200"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:55Z","remediation":"将 syslog-ng 升级至 1.4.15（1.4.x 系列）或 1.5.20（1.5.x 系列）及以上版本。Debian 用户可通过 apt-get install syslog-ng 更新至 DSA-175 修复版本。如无法立即升级，可在 syslog-ng.conf 中禁用模板文件名（template filenames）和模板输出（template output）功能，避免使用宏展开（macro expansion）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000547","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103426595021928&w=2","http://www.balabit.hu/static/zsa/ZSA-2002-014-en.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-175","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10339.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2513.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_039_syslog_ng.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5934","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1200.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1200.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1200","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/280b44dba3ccda95bef6ae4930447a6bec9136f3/data/2002/CVE-2002-1200.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rjhm-8rqf-6wp8/GHSA-rjhm-8rqf-6wp8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-175.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5934/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2002.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--82edbceb-bbdf-4dd1-b78b-7f6cebc0a5b0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0550","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1178","title":"Jetty HTTP Server CGIServlet 目录遍历任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Jetty HTTP Server 4.1.0 之前版本中的 CGIServlet 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 cgi-bin 目录发送包含 `..\\`（点-点-反斜杠）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制访问任意目录并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Jetty 3.1.6/3.1.7/4.1 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至 Jetty 4.1.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1178"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52Z","remediation":"升级 Jetty 至 4.1.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 CGIServlet 对 `..\\` 序列的路径校验缺陷。如无法升级，可禁用 CGIServlet 或通过反向代理限制对 `/cgi-bin/` 路径的访问，并过滤包含 `..\\` 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://groups.yahoo.com/group/jetty-announce/message/45","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103358725813039&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10246.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5852","http://www.westpoint.ltd.uk/advisories/wp-02-0011.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21895","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1178.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1178.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1178","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1178.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1178.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c23d699ab95dd8042ecb6df739cafdf209913a6/2002/CVE-2002-1178.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1178.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1178","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1178.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0546","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1147","title":"HP Procurve 4000M Switch HTTP管理接口拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP Procurve 4000M 交换机 HTTP 管理接口存在未授权设备重置漏洞。该交换机在启用堆叠功能与远程管理的情况下，其 HTTP 管理界面未对设备重置请求进行身份认证，远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可直接向 device_reset CGI 程序发送特制请求，导致目标设备被重置，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响固件版本低于 C.09.16 的 HP Procurve 4000M 交换机，攻击复杂度较低，且已有公开利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1147"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:48Z","remediation":"将 HP Procurve 4000M 交换机固件升级至 C.09.16 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议禁用远程管理功能或通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制对 HTTP 管理接口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 地址连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103287951910420&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4501","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10172.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5784","http://www.tech-serve.com/research/advisories/2002/a092302-1.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21828","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1147","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2002/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1147.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1147.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1147.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0455","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0455.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0866","title":"Microsoft VM JDBC 类远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft VM（Java 虚拟机）中的 JDBC（Java 数据库连接）类存在 DLL 加载执行漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 Java Applet 的网页，利用 com.ms.jdbc.odbc.JdbcOdbc 类的构造函数传入以空字符结尾的恶意 DLL 路径，从而在目标系统上加载并执行任意动态链接库（DLL），实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft VM 5.0.3805 及之前所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0866"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:17Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-052 提供的补丁 (Q329077)。若当前 Microsoft VM 版本低于 5.0.3805，须先升级至 build 3805 再打补丁。由于 Microsoft Java Virtual Machine 已停止支持，强烈建议彻底卸载 Microsoft VM 并迁移至现代 Java 运行时环境（如 OpenJDK），同时在 Internet Explorer 安全设置中禁用 Java Applet 以阻断攻击入口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0271.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10133.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/307306","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5751","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-052","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21808","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0866.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0866.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0866.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0866","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0866.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0866.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0866.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0866.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2002/CVE-2002-0866.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0866.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0455.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0455.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0455.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0299","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1152","title":"KDE Konqueror 浏览器安全 Cookie 泄露漏洞","description":"KDE 3.0 至 3.0.2 版本的 Konqueror 浏览器在处理 HTTP Cookie 时存在安全缺陷，无法正确识别和执行 Cookie 的 \"secure\" 标志。攻击者可以通过诱导用户在非加密通道（HTTP）上发送本应仅在加密通道（HTTPS）传输的敏感 Cookie，从而通过网络嗅探手段窃取用户会话信息。该漏洞影响使用相关版本的 KDE 桌面环境的用户，攻击条件为目标在非加密网络环境下运行且 Cookie 包含 secure 标志。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1152"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:49Z","remediation":"建议将 KDE 桌面环境及 Konqueror 浏览器升级至 3.0.3 或更高版本。在升级完成前，建议用户避免在不信任的网络环境中使用 Konqueror 访问需要安全 Cookie 的敏感网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103175827225044&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10083.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20020908-1.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5691"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0299.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0297","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0297.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1151","title":"KDE Konqueror 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"KDE 浏览器 Konqueror（版本 2.2.2 及 3.0 至 3.0.3）在处理子框架（sub-frames）和子内联框架（sub-iframes）时，未能正确初始化域名，导致其跨站脚本（XSS）防护机制失效。远程攻击者可以通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页，利用该漏洞在其他域名的子框架中执行任意脚本，从而实现窃取用户 Cookie 等敏感信息。该漏洞影响范围包括上述特定版本的 Konqueror 浏览器，攻击条件为用户访问受控页面。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1151"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:49Z","remediation":"建议将 KDE 升级至 3.0.4 或更高版本，以修复 Konqueror 在处理子框架域初始化时的逻辑缺陷。对于无法立即升级的用户，建议临时禁用浏览器中不必要的框架加载功能，或切换至安全性更高的现代浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000525","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103175850925395&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-167","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10039.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20020908-2.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-064.php","http://www.osvdb.org/7867","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-221.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5689","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1151","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1678061d20f9336914de78aef7c69168db2a7f8c/2002/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1151.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/f4ac1c4571cf4619eb3fd2e729b251b1c03b9450/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1151.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1151.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0296","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1148","title":"Apache Tomcat 3/4 DefaultServlet 文件泄漏漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.x 和 4.x 版本中默认的 DefaultServlet（org.apache.catalina.servlets.DefaultServlet）存在文件泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过直接向该 Servlet 发送特制请求，读取 Web 应用目录下的任意文件内容，包括 JSP 源代码等可能包含数据库用户名和密码等敏感信息的文件。攻击条件简单，仅需目标 Tomcat 服务器开放 HTTP 端口即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1148"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:48Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Apache Tomcat 4.1.12 或 4.0.5 及以上版本，该漏洞已在上述版本中修复。由于 Tomcat 4.x 已停止维护，强烈建议升级至 Tomcat 9.0.x 或更高版本以获得持续安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在 web.xml 中移除或限制 DefaultServlet 的访问路径，或通过防火墙/反向代理限制对 /servlet/ 路径的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103288242014253&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4758","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-170","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10175.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-217.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-218.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5786","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/29dc6c2b625789e70a9c4756b5a327e6547273ff8bde7e0327af48c5%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/c62b0e3a7bf23342352a5810c640a94b6db69957c5c19db507004d74%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb71997f506c6cc8b530dd845c084995a9878098846c7b4eacfae8db3%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21853","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1148.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1148.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2002/CVE-2002-1148.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/GHSA/data/2002/CVE-2002-1148.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1148","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/d5067406bc0902f8174cb5f8d595f637951974ce/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1148.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1148.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aea030fdb9f850918f67ec4845c1a97cd9f61f7a/2002/CVE-2002-1148.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/maven/org.apache.tomcat/tomcat/CVE-2002-1148.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0296.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0296.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0296.toml"}]